{"id":"daty","name":"Daty","tagline":"Free Wikidata editor","blurb":"Daty is a free Wikidata editor adhering to GNOME Human Interface Guidelines, intended to enable a better editing workflow and faster deployment of requested user features for Wikidata.","description":"Daty is a free Wikidata editor adhering to GNOME Human Interface Guidelines, intended to enable a better editing workflow and faster deployment of requested user features for Wikidata.\n\nUse Daty to search, select, read, batch edit items, script actions, share, visualize proposed changes and bots.\n\nWARNING: This is a preview release, so entities editing is disabled.","developer":"Pellegrino Prevete","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ml/prevete/Daty/84e09c1d80570cb3d94abad0b62178f9/icons/128x128/ml.prevete.Daty.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ml/prevete/Daty/84e09c1d80570cb3d94abad0b62178f9/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ml/prevete/Daty/84e09c1d80570cb3d94abad0b62178f9/screenshots/image-1_752x566@1.png","w":814,"h":613},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ml/prevete/Daty/84e09c1d80570cb3d94abad0b62178f9/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ml/prevete/Daty/84e09c1d80570cb3d94abad0b62178f9/screenshots/image-2_224x310@1.png","w":432,"h":598},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ml/prevete/Daty/84e09c1d80570cb3d94abad0b62178f9/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ml/prevete/Daty/84e09c1d80570cb3d94abad0b62178f9/screenshots/image-3_224x315@1.png","w":428,"h":603},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ml/prevete/Daty/84e09c1d80570cb3d94abad0b62178f9/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ml/prevete/Daty/84e09c1d80570cb3d94abad0b62178f9/screenshots/image-4_752x444@1.png","w":911,"h":539}],"categories":["Networking"],"tags":["network"],"license":"GPL-3.0","platforms":["linux"],"homepage":"https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/Daty/","stars":null,"version":"